=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  timesync hardn -----------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Ubuntu$
# 26.04, whose time service is chrony. hardn's file names the$
# two servers, Ubuntu's pools are switched off, and the clock$
# follows the first. The one item undoes it.$
$
# NTP Settings #################################################$
$
  [+] NTP                  + 192.0.2.10$
$
  Time ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Service              chrony$
  [+] Clock                In sync$
   -  Synced to            192.0.2.10$
   -  Server               192.0.2.10 by hardn$
   -  Server               192.0.2.11 by hardn$
   -  File                 /etc/chrony/sources.d/hardn.sources$
   -  hardn.yml            192.0.2.10, 192.0.2.11$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Remove servers       Undo hardn's change$
   2) Refresh              Read the host again$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-2 or q]:$
$
$

